---
title: Attack Khan
description: Send your armies against Khan camps for event points and loot, and see every setting of the plugin.
---

{% icon id="wolf-head" size=32 /%}The Attack Khan {% term id="plugin" %}plugin{% /term %} sends your armies at {% term id="khan-camp" %}Khan camps{% /term %} while the event runs. It counts toward your {% term id="attack-cap" %}attack cap{% /term %}.

Keeping your defence filled: {% status kind="beta" /%} The Khan chain earns most of its points from Khan attacks your castle defends. With **Refill the defence after each Khan attack** on, the bot refills the walls, gate, moat and courtyard of your main castle after each Khan attack lands. It fills them back to the layout they held when the plugin started, with tools from storage. Set your defence in the game before you start the plugin.

